1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,660
Wealth, Fame, Power.

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,597
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:07,237
attained this and everything
else the world had to offer,

4
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:10,496
and his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

5
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:11,955
You want my treasure?

6
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,420
You can have it.

7
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:16,620
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

8
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:19,060
Now you just have to find it.

9
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:24,217
These words lured men to
the Grand Line in pursuit

10
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,397
of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine.

11
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:29,600
This is the time known
as the Great Pirate Era.

12
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:35,260
Come aboard and bring along
all your hopes and dreams.

13
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:40,460
Together we will find everything
that we're looking for.

14
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:42,680
One Piece.

15
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:52,537
Compass left behind,
it'll only slow us down.

16
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:58,497
Your heart will be your guide,
raise the sails and take the helm.

17
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:03,837
That legendary place that
the end of the map reveals.

18
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:10,157
Is only legendary until
someone proves it real?

19
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:14,560
Through it all, through
all the trouble and times,

20
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:16,817
through the heartache
and through the pain.

21
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:21,077
Know that I will be there to stand by you!

22
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:24,277
Just like I know you'll stand by me!

23
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:28,237
So come aboard and bring along.

24
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:30,560
All your hopes and dreams.

25
00:01:31,420 --> 00:01:33,877
Together we will find everything.

26
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:35,960
That we're looking for.

27
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:39,697
There's always room for you.

28
00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:42,440
If you wanna be my friend?

29
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:46,880
We are, we are on a cruise.

30
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,740
We are

31
00:01:50,740 --> 00:01:53,420
Come, come, bazooka!

32
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:56,840
We have to retreat!

33
00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:00,620
We're doomed to run for your lives!

34
00:02:07,260 --> 00:02:08,840
Is everyone here?

35
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:10,660
Okay, buddy, check.

36
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:12,977
Sound off if you think
you're missing yours.

37
00:02:13,060 --> 00:02:13,890
I'm here!

38
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,040
Got mine.

39
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:16,140
Right here.

40
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,510
Okay.

41
00:02:17,593 --> 00:02:20,160
Captain Buggy didn't make it back!

42
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:21,620
He's not all here!

43
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:31,120
At last, my flashy raft is finished!

44
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:37,520
I swear, I'll get you! Nooo!

45
00:02:46,300 --> 00:02:48,680
That luck just makes me stronger!

46
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,160
Bring it on!

47
00:03:01,420 --> 00:03:02,260
Lunchtime!

48
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:12,480
Got you, marpoon!

49
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,480
Just accept it.

50
00:03:21,740 --> 00:03:23,280
Your time has come.

51
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:35,080
It was just a joke!

52
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:38,330
Give me!

53
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,460
Closer! Closer!

54
00:03:55,860 --> 00:03:57,600
My plan is perfection!

55
00:03:58,460 --> 00:03:59,290
On! On! On!

56
00:04:01,220 --> 00:04:02,050
On!

57
00:04:02,133 --> 00:04:04,160
On! On! On! Stupid boy! Ha-ha-ha!

58
00:04:07,820 --> 00:04:09,740
Hehehehe! Hehehehe! Hehehehe!

59
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:11,730
Hehehehe!

60
00:04:11,813 --> 00:04:12,643
I got you!

61
00:04:12,726 --> 00:04:13,680
Oh crap, you got me!

62
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:15,097
What the hell just happened?!

63
00:04:15,180 --> 00:04:16,220
AAAAAAAA!

64
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:19,000
Oh! Stop it! Stop it!

65
00:04:19,260 --> 00:04:20,220
Stop it!

66
00:04:20,700 --> 00:04:22,580
Oh no! No!

67
00:04:23,740 --> 00:04:25,780
The end is there! Huh?

68
00:04:29,220 --> 00:04:30,050
Yes!

69
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,300
Where am I?

70
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:45,840
You must leave!

71
00:04:46,820 --> 00:04:47,840
Says who?

72
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:51,260
If you want to live, you must leave!

73
00:04:55,540 --> 00:04:57,260
What are these things?

74
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,678
These are the animals of the forest!

75
00:04:59,980 --> 00:05:02,720
If you touch them, you
will be annihilated!

76
00:05:03,860 --> 00:05:05,417
Wow, these guys are flashy!

77
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:06,980
It's okay.

78
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:10,260
I warned you not to take another step!

79
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:15,520
How dare you shoot at me!

80
00:05:16,020 --> 00:05:17,140
Crap, I missed!

81
00:05:17,860 --> 00:05:19,140
There you are!

82
00:05:20,180 --> 00:05:21,500
What the hell?!

83
00:05:23,340 --> 00:05:24,600
You're mine!

84
00:05:25,460 --> 00:05:26,760
Now get out here!

85
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:30,360
You have Devil Fruit powers!

86
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,297
So what if I do?

87
00:05:32,380 --> 00:05:33,957
You're just a...

88
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,920
you're just a...

89
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:37,560
What are you?

90
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:45,100
Like a jack-in-the-box or something?

91
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:49,117
Yes, ironically, I am in
a box, and my name is...

92
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:50,040
No, you idiot!

93
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,840
I'm a person, not a toy!

94
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:57,800
Also, I will kill you if you go anywhere
near my precious animals, so watch it.

95
00:05:57,900 --> 00:06:00,157
I will not hesitate to put you down.

96
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:06,700
Oh you wanna fight I admire your
stupidity, even if it gets you killed?

97
00:06:22,500 --> 00:06:24,560
That's no fair using weapons!

98
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:27,397
What the hell do you call this?

99
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:29,180
Heh, heh, heh, heh, heh.

100
00:06:29,420 --> 00:06:31,479
Say your prayers and say them fast!

101
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:48,660
Shut up, quick escape!

102
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:10,464
Too bad for you, but I can't allow anyone
to live who tries to hurt these animals.

103
00:07:10,780 --> 00:07:15,662
The only reason anyone ever comes to this
island is to take these precious animals!

104
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,940
Why would I care about
some stupid animals?

105
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:21,577
Huh? So...

106
00:07:21,660 --> 00:07:23,200
then you're not a poacher?

107
00:07:36,900 --> 00:07:38,077
So what do you think?

108
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:41,278
It's some pretty good sake,
if I don't say so myself.

109
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:43,077
Oh, it's the best!

110
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:45,866
It's been a while since
I've had a good drink.

111
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,917
Have as much as you'd like.

112
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,500
I can always make more.

113
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:53,820
I'm sorry about that misunderstanding
earlier. Don't worry.

114
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,357
All that's behind us now.

115
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:57,087
No need to mention it again.

116
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:58,830
Cheers!

117
00:08:09,260 --> 00:08:12,580
Thanks for helping me
rebuild my flashy raft.

118
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:14,054
No problem, my friend.

119
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,960
I like working with my hands.

120
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:19,580
We'll meet again someday.

121
00:08:20,140 --> 00:08:21,160
I'd like that.

122
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:36,300
Good-bye, my friend!

123
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,040
Take care of yourself!

124
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,020
Good-bye!

125
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:49,300
Sensei!

126
00:08:58,900 --> 00:09:05,900
I'm sorry I forgot to warn you about
the monsters, but I know you'll be okay.

127
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:12,940
No, go the other way!

128
00:09:21,380 --> 00:09:24,900
Oh, that's just great! Swim! Go, Buggy!

129
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:28,650
Hey!

130
00:09:28,820 --> 00:09:29,960
Get out of there!

131
00:09:30,260 --> 00:09:31,580
He looks hungry!

132
00:09:35,580 --> 00:09:36,410
Huh?

133
00:09:36,493 --> 00:09:37,323
What's that?

134
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:06,937
Oh she's hot wait for me
I haven't seen a woman

135
00:10:07,020 --> 00:10:11,117
in over 20 years well
that's a pirate's luck for!

136
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:16,217
If I've ever seen it I was worried about

137
00:10:16,300 --> 00:10:22,797
thanks

138
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:28,157
I owe you

139
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:30,797
one I thought it was

140
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:33,997
a Goner for sure it's really no big deal

141
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:38,120
buggy the pirate cloud right what's it?

142
00:10:39,780 --> 00:10:40,610
to you!

143
00:10:40,693 --> 00:10:42,080
Just who are you, lady?

144
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:44,557
I'm looking for a certain young pirate.

145
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:46,060
I think you know

146
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:50,350
him.

147
00:10:50,433 --> 00:10:51,263
That's him!

148
00:10:51,346 --> 00:10:52,320
Stupid brat!

149
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:55,717
Just wait till I get my
hands on you! You're dead!

150
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:56,660
Is that

151
00:10:59,460 --> 00:11:00,657
the guy you're looking for?

152
00:11:00,740 --> 00:11:01,780
I see.

153
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,200
Now I understand.

154
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:05,597
So that's why you saved my life.

155
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:08,380
So then, What do you say?

156
00:11:12,500 --> 00:11:13,540
Hell yes!

157
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:18,038
We both want to kill the same stupid
kids, so we should work together!

158
00:11:18,140 --> 00:11:18,970
That's great.

159
00:11:19,380 --> 00:11:20,720
Let's drink on it.

160
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,360
Captain Buggy!

161
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:40,440
Before he died, I hated Captain Buggy.

162
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:42,817
I always thought he was
cruel and heartless.

163
00:11:42,900 --> 00:11:44,797
But now I see how hard he worked.

164
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:47,762
He really just wanted what
was best for his crew.

165
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:51,917
Well, Captain Buggy, we were able to
pillage and plunder to all odds content.

166
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:55,235
I don't know if it'll be the
same with another Captain.

167
00:11:55,940 --> 00:11:57,757
Let's honor our missing leader.

168
00:11:57,840 --> 00:12:00,360
He deserves a flashy goodbye from us.

169
00:12:02,460 --> 00:12:04,860
Rest in peace, Captain.

170
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:08,500
Leave it to me, your faithful number two.

171
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:12,160
Cabaji, the acrobat is
ready to take your place!

172
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:18,153
I will take the helm and lead the buggy
pirates back on the path to glory!

173
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,070
Stop right there!

174
00:12:20,153 --> 00:12:20,983
Cabaji!

175
00:12:22,020 --> 00:12:23,040
It is I,

176
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,137
Beast Tame Emoji,

177
00:12:24,220 --> 00:12:27,717
the captain's right-hand man who should
take his proper place as our leader.

178
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:32,417
I've always been the next in line and
nobody is going to take that away from me.

179
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:35,382
I'll be glad to take you
as my second in command!

180
00:12:36,220 --> 00:12:40,985
All right then looks like we'll have a
fight to see who will be the next captain.

181
00:12:41,520 --> 00:12:43,100
That's just fine by me.

182
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,270
KAMETING!

183
00:13:10,780 --> 00:13:11,610
KAMETING!

184
00:13:11,693 --> 00:13:12,523
KAMETING! KAMETING!

185
00:13:12,606 --> 00:13:13,436
KAMETING!

186
00:13:13,519 --> 00:13:14,349
KAMETING!

187
00:13:14,432 --> 00:13:15,397
KAMETING! KAMETING!
KAMETING! KAMETING! KAMETING!

188
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,310
KAMETING!

189
00:13:16,393 --> 00:13:17,223
KAMETING! KAMETING!

190
00:13:17,306 --> 00:13:28,179
KAMETING!

191
00:13:28,262 --> 00:13:29,092
KAMETING! KAMETING!

192
00:13:29,175 --> 00:13:30,005
KAMETING!

193
00:13:30,088 --> 00:13:30,918
KAMETING!

194
00:13:31,001 --> 00:13:31,831
KAMETING!

195
00:13:31,914 --> 00:13:32,744
KAMETING! KAMETING!
KAMETING! KAMETING! KAMETING!

196
00:13:32,827 --> 00:13:33,657
KAMET We'll settle this the
old-fashioned way hand-to-hand combat,

197
00:13:33,740 --> 00:13:34,570
and I wouldn't have it any other way now
I get to tear you apart limb from limb

198
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:47,160
It's no use just give up

199
00:13:48,260 --> 00:13:51,137
You know you can't take it anymore.

200
00:13:51,220 --> 00:13:54,040
I didn't understand anything you just said

201
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:18,120
Ritchie!

202
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:20,180
The greatest captain ever!

203
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:54,617
Captain Richie, Captain
Richie, he's a driver!

204
00:14:54,700 --> 00:14:58,457
After the loss of Captain Buggy,
Ritchie is the one who will lead us now.

205
00:14:58,540 --> 00:15:00,240
All hail Captain Ritchie!

206
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:42,420
You are trespassing.

207
00:15:42,660 --> 00:15:46,954
This island belongs to the Bearclaw
tribe and you will be shown no mercy.

208
00:15:47,040 --> 00:15:48,120
Help, Captain!

209
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:55,780
We shall fight to the death.

210
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:15,960
We surrender.

211
00:16:22,740 --> 00:16:24,437
Did you find something?

212
00:16:24,520 --> 00:16:31,060
Look, that's my ship, the grand
flashy flagship of the Buggy Pirates!

213
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:34,397
But who would do this?

214
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:36,480
Who would use such an old picture?

215
00:16:37,960 --> 00:16:39,517
And what did they bury?

216
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:43,860
Hey, there's somebody passed out
on the ground over there? Huh?

217
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:45,510
No!

218
00:16:46,380 --> 00:16:48,120
Moji! Cabaji!

219
00:16:48,460 --> 00:16:50,460
What the hell happened to you two?

220
00:16:51,220 --> 00:16:53,240
C-Captain Buggy!

221
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:57,960
You're alive!

222
00:16:59,420 --> 00:17:01,260
Never leave us again!

223
00:17:02,380 --> 00:17:04,720
We've gone to a camp forever!

224
00:17:05,540 --> 00:17:07,440
I miss you guys so much!

225
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:12,300
So, uh, who kicked your asses?

226
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:15,220
I'd like to say hello.

227
00:17:16,180 --> 00:17:20,080
Uh, I don't remember anything
except getting knocked out.

228
00:17:20,820 --> 00:17:24,560
They were attacked, but I
have no idea who did it.

229
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:29,245
Looks like your boys have been
introduced to the Bearclaw tribe.

230
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:33,260
We better hurry up if you
want to save your crew.

231
00:17:34,820 --> 00:17:37,180
The Bearclaws are cannibals.

232
00:17:51,780 --> 00:17:53,297
There's a crab in the pot!

233
00:17:53,380 --> 00:17:54,477
You can't eat us now!

234
00:17:54,560 --> 00:17:56,089
I can't die, Pete, myself!

235
00:17:56,300 --> 00:17:58,418
We'll all be dry and stringy anyway!

236
00:17:58,780 --> 00:17:59,880
Just eat this guy!

237
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:00,897
He looks tasty!

238
00:18:00,980 --> 00:18:03,257
He's got much more meat
in his bones than I do!

239
00:18:03,340 --> 00:18:04,170
Eat him!

240
00:18:04,253 --> 00:18:05,157
This isn't happening!

241
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:06,475
This isn't happening!

242
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:09,790
Don't worry.

243
00:18:10,020 --> 00:18:11,277
It'll all be over soon.

244
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:12,831
We're the Bearclaw tribe.

245
00:18:13,060 --> 00:18:16,295
We know how to prepare anyone
to taste quite delicious.

246
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:22,614
What are we gonna do with these things?

247
00:18:23,100 --> 00:18:23,930
Appetizers?

248
00:18:24,013 --> 00:18:26,437
I'm not so sure those chumps
would be very good to eat.

249
00:18:26,520 --> 00:18:27,755
Give them to the dog.

250
00:18:28,600 --> 00:18:29,430
No way.

251
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:31,277
I think it might make him throw up.

252
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:32,400
Chop, chop.

253
00:18:37,280 --> 00:18:38,900
Chop, chop, chop, chop!

254
00:19:05,980 --> 00:19:07,540
It can't be!

255
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:12,480
Jump, Flashy! Reassemble!

256
00:19:50,620 --> 00:19:57,520
And now, my favorite, showtime,
Super Flushing Buggy Ball!

257
00:20:08,700 --> 00:20:10,220
Oh, Ritchie!

258
00:20:19,060 --> 00:20:20,500
Acrobat Techniques!

259
00:20:20,700 --> 00:20:22,760
Extreme Wrath of the Steam Bash!

260
00:20:23,100 --> 00:20:25,460
It's time for the Beast Tape emoji!

261
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:35,217
I'm Captain Buggy the Clown Pirate!

262
00:20:35,300 --> 00:20:38,712
You didn't really think you'd
be able to hurt me, did you?

263
00:20:39,780 --> 00:20:43,017
Your tribe has done such a
good job looking after my men.

264
00:20:43,100 --> 00:20:44,747
Let me give you your reward.

265
00:20:45,180 --> 00:20:46,740
Like them, boys!

266
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:50,420
You're some kid!

267
00:20:57,080 --> 00:20:58,780
Chop-chop! Punch!

268
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:02,160
Try to eat us now!

269
00:21:13,580 --> 00:21:14,410
Thank you!

270
00:21:14,560 --> 00:21:15,640
You saved us!

271
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:20,820
My adorable little children,
I've missed you all so very much.

272
00:21:21,020 --> 00:21:22,657
Where have you been, Captain, sir?

273
00:21:22,740 --> 00:21:25,269
Please tell us what
happened to you at sea!

274
00:21:30,060 --> 00:21:33,297
That damn Straw Hat is the
reason for all of this.

275
00:21:33,380 --> 00:21:36,380
I promise that I will make him pay!

276
00:21:38,040 --> 00:21:39,760
Um, Captain Buggy, sir?

277
00:21:40,040 --> 00:21:41,400
Who's the pretty lady?

278
00:21:42,180 --> 00:21:46,180
This is the woman who saved
my life, and her name is...

279
00:21:46,900 --> 00:21:47,840
Hold on.

280
00:21:48,280 --> 00:21:49,940
I don't know her name.

281
00:21:50,420 --> 00:21:52,302
Sorry, what was your name again?

282
00:21:56,080 --> 00:21:56,910
Alright!

283
00:21:56,993 --> 00:21:59,160
The Buggy Pirates are back together!

284
00:22:01,980 --> 00:22:05,080
So, Captain, what orders
do you have for us?

285
00:22:05,260 --> 00:22:08,440
To find and kill Monkey D. Luffy!

286
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:31,077
Me I cannot understand.

287
00:22:31,160 --> 00:22:33,797
As I face what I must do!

288
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:36,197
I'll say goodbye and screech your hand.

289
00:22:36,280 --> 00:22:38,157
I've said sail alone.

290
00:22:38,240 --> 00:22:40,017
But always now I'm done.

291
00:22:40,100 --> 00:22:41,117
I'll keep you near.

292
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:43,017
As I drift away.

293
00:22:43,100 --> 00:22:45,820
I pray you watch me as I disappear?

294
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:53,717
As I watch the sun rise.

295
00:22:53,800 --> 00:22:55,857
I began to wonder.

296
00:22:55,940 --> 00:22:58,337
What could be the reason?

297
00:22:58,420 --> 00:23:03,057
It's so hot inside, no answer has come.

298
00:23:03,140 --> 00:23:06,637
But I can't get away from what's true.

299
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:09,180
It's because of you.

300
00:23:12,020 --> 00:23:16,777
Show me how to catch those feelings,
get them to come back to me.

301
00:23:16,860 --> 00:23:21,837
I'll do what I must because
they're everything I want will be.

302
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:26,417
Pack these arms around my dreams
and pull them back from yesterday.

303
00:23:26,500 --> 00:23:31,820
If I'm holding hands with you,
I'm sure that we can make the way.
